  > flag_groups.go::const.MarkFlagsRequiredTogether #452856dc514c
#c4[overview,i5] Cobra automatically generates shell completion scripts for bash, zsh, fish, and powershell by dynamically injecting a hidden completion command into the application's command tree.
  > README.md::Overview #311fca062beb
