?p1 What is the command to install the latest version of the Cobra library?
  = go get -u github.com/spf13/cobra@latest
  > README.md::Installing #5bc0042d4cc1
?p2 What value must the global environment variable COBRA_ACTIVE_HELP be set to in order to disable ActiveHelp?
  = "0"
  > active_help.go:28 #226a161c1dd8
?p3 How does OnlyValidArgs handle descriptions in the ValidArgs field?
  = It splits the string by a tab character and uses only the first part.
  > args.go::OnlyValidArgs.len #180a4ce0fe52
?p4 What constant is used to annotate flags that require custom Go-based completion?
  = BashCompCustom
  > bash_completions.go:31 #b558243115d5
?p5 What is the minimum Bash major version required for command aliases to be generated?
  = 3 (specifically, greater than 3).
  > bash_completions.go::writeCmdAliases.WriteStringAndCheck #a2541d68bb3a
?p6 What happens when CheckErr is called with a non-nil argument?
  = It prints 'Error:' followed by the message to os.Stderr and exits with code 1.
  > cobra.go:234-235 #9db66ad31e49
?p7 What is the first function executed in the command run sequence?
  = PersistentPreRun
  > command.go:118 #e2f3cc3edd2f
?p8 What happens to persistent hook execution if EnableTraverseRunHooks is false?
  = Only the first found persistent hook is executed.
  > command.go:989-991 #5b84cb3e88c9
?p9 What happens if a command attempts to add itself as a child via AddCommand?
  = It panics.
  > command.go::AddCommand #194dc973d95b
?p10 What happens to the command's flag set during `mergePersistentFlags`?
  = It adds the command's own persistent flags and the persistent flags of all its parents to the command's flag set.
  > command.go::mergePersistentFlags #6efc224471f1
?p11 On which operating systems is this file excluded from the build?
  = Windows
  > command_notwin.go:15 #e7e0f97e7ab2
?p12 What exit code is used when the mousetrap condition is triggered?
  = 1
  > command_win.go::preExecHookFn.preExecHook #73c43e7b2994
?p13 What is the integer value of the default shell completion directive?
  = 0
  > completions.go:95 #322bfac92db2
?p14 Which environment variable controls the file path used for completion debug logging?
  = BASH_COMP_DEBUG_FILE
  > completions.go::CompDebug #ca9b8e952c6d
?p15 What characters are replaced by underscores in the command name when generating the variable name?
  = Hyphens (-) and colons (:).
  > fish_completions.go:28-29 #b0c5a53682cf
?p16 What is the return value of ValidateFlagGroups if DisableFlagParsing is set to true?
  = nil
  > flag_groups.go::ValidateFlagGroups #5246e195d668
?p17 What PowerShell version threshold triggers the legacy argument passing logic?
  = 7.2.0
